-- Q9: hospitalized because my son bit me in the ankle; wellness-visit proof
-- provided 6 months after the effective date (within the 7-month deadline);
-- I was serving as a police officer at the time of hospitalization. Being a
-- police officer at the time is occupational status, not the cause of the
-- injury -- the son biting my ankle plainly did not arise "out of ...
-- service in the police" -- so the §3.1(4) exclusion is not triggered.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `age at hospitalization`                                          IS 40
    `months since the effective date at hospitalization`              IS 1
    `wellness visit occurred within six months of the effective date` IS TRUE
    `wellness confirmation submission month`                          IS JUST 6
    `fraud or misrepresentation`                                      IS FALSE
    `confined in a hospital in the United States`                     IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                                  IS 1
    `claim made to the Company`                                       IS TRUE
    `injury arose from skydiving`                                     IS FALSE
    `injury arose from military service`                              IS FALSE
    `injury arose from firefighter service`                           IS FALSE
    `injury arose from police service`                                IS FALSE
#EVAL `covered` q9
